<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective December 20.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     21.45     20.80	  5.58-10.93 5.90-11.39</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     21.45     20.80	  5.39-10.41 5.71-10.87</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.03     24.00	  12.89	13.61</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.03     24.00	  8.20	 8.71</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.25	0.24	  0.40	 0.40</p>
</text>
